@startuml WeClawBotNotify_ApplicationSequence

title WeClawBotNotify V1 - Application 管理序列图

actor "用户" as User
participant "Web 管理后台\n(浏览器)" as Web
participant "server/HTTPServer" as API
participant "middleware/ClientAuth" as ClientAuth
participant "auth/AccountService" as AccountSvc
participant "application/ApplicationService" as AppSvc
participant "SQLite" as DB

== 创建 Application ==

User -> Web : 点击"创建 Application"\n输入名称 (如 "Jenkins CI")\n描述 (如 "CI/CD 构建通知")
activate Web

Web -> API : POST /api/application\n{ name: "Jenkins CI",\n  description: "CI/CD 构建通知" }\nAuthorization: Bearer {jwt}
activate API

API -> ClientAuth : authenticate(request)
activate ClientAuth
ClientAuth -> AccountSvc : verifyJWT(jwt)
activate AccountSvc
AccountSvc --> ClientAuth : (userId, nil)
deactivate AccountSvc
ClientAuth --> API : authenticated(userId)
deactivate ClientAuth

API -> AppSvc : createApplication(userId, name, desc)
activate AppSvc

AppSvc -> AppSvc : generateAppToken()\n生成随机 Token (如 app_xxx...)

AppSvc -> AppSvc : hashToken(token)\n存储 hash 而非明文

AppSvc -> DB : INSERT INTO applications\n(user_id, token, name, description, created_at)\nVALUES (?, ?, ?, ?, ?)
activate DB
DB --> AppSvc : appId
deactivate DB

AppSvc --> API : Application { id, token (明文仅此一次), name, description }
note right
  Token 明文仅在创建时返回一次
  之后只存储 hash
  用户必须妥善保存
end note
deactivate AppSvc

API --> Web : 200 OK\n{ id, token: "app_xxx...", name, description, createdAt }
deactivate API

Web --> User : ✅ Application 创建成功\n⚠️ 请立即复制保存\nToken 仅显示一次！
deactivate Web

== 查看 Application 列表 ==

User -> Web : 查看 Application 管理页面
activate Web

Web -> API : GET /api/application\nAuthorization: Bearer {jwt}
activate API

API -> ClientAuth : authenticate(request)
activate ClientAuth
ClientAuth --> API : authenticated(userId)
deactivate ClientAuth

API -> AppSvc : getApplications(userId)
activate AppSvc

AppSvc -> DB : SELECT id, name, description,\n  default_priority, created_at, last_used_at\nFROM applications\nWHERE user_id = ?
activate DB
DB --> AppSvc : rows
deactivate DB

AppSvc --> API : Application[]\n[ { id, name, description, createdAt, lastUsedAt } ]
note right
  不返回 token 明文
  仅返回元信息
end note
deactivate AppSvc

API --> Web : 200 OK\n{ applications: [...] }
deactivate API

Web --> User : 显示 Application 列表\n(名称、描述、创建时间、最后使用时间)
deactivate Web

== 删除 Application ==

User -> Web : 点击"删除"某个Application
activate Web

Web -> API : DELETE /api/application/:id\nAuthorization: Bearer {jwt}
activate API

API -> ClientAuth : authenticate(request)
activate ClientAuth
ClientAuth --> API : authenticated(userId)
deactivate ClientAuth

API -> AppSvc : deleteApplication(userId, appId)
activate AppSvc

AppSvc -> DB : DELETE FROM applications\nWHERE id = ? AND user_id = ?
activate DB
DB --> AppSvc : rowsAffected
deactivate DB

alt Application 不存在或不属于该用户
  AppSvc --> API : Error: application not found
  API --> Web : 404 Application not found
else 删除成功
  AppSvc --> API : nil
  API --> Web : 200 OK
end
deactivate AppSvc

deactivate API

Web --> User : ✅ Application 已删除\n使用此Token的外部系统将无法再调用API
deactivate Web

note over User, DB
  Application Token 用途：
  外部系统调用 POST /api/message 时
  在 Authorization 头携带 Bearer {appToken}
  ApplicationService.validateAppToken() 验证并提取 userId
end note

@enduml
